<title>USA: Conference Board leading index historical data.</title>
<headline>Conference Board leading index historical data.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Conference Board issued historical data comparing the monthly changes in its newly revamped index of leading indicators to changes under the previous method. Following lists monthly percent changes and the index dating back to January 1995.</p>
<p> -     NEW METHOD   OLD METHOD	   NEW METHOD   OLD METHOD</p>
<p> 1996: Pct  Index   Pct  Index   1995: Pct  Index   Pct  Index</p>
<p> Dec   ---  -----   ---  ----     Dec  0.3  101.2   0.3  100.9</p>
<p> Nov   0.1  102.6   N/A   N/A     Nov  0.0  100.9  -0.1  100.6</p>
<p> Oct   0.0  102.5   0.1  103.6    Oct -0.2  100.9  -0.4  100.7</p>
<p> Sept  0.1  102.5   0.2  103.5   Sept  0.1  101.1  -0.1  101.1</p>
<p> Aug   0.1  102.4   0.1  103.3    Aug  0.3  101.0   0.1  101.2</p>
<p> July  0.0  102.3   0.2  103.2   July  0.2  100.7  -0.2  101.1</p>
<p> June  0.2  102.3   0.4  103.0   June  0.1  100.5   0.2  101.3</p>
<p> May   0.3  102.1   0.3  102.6    May -0.2  100.4  -0.2  101.1</p>
<p> Apr   0.2  101.8   0.4  102.3    Apr -0.1  100.6  -0.6  101.3</p>
<p> Mar   0.2  101.6   0.3  101.9    Mar -0.4  100.7  -0.5  101.9</p>
<p> Feb   0.9  101.4   1.2  101.6    Feb -0.4  101.1  -0.2  102.4</p>
<p> Jan  -0.7  100.5  -0.5  100.4    Jan -0.1  101.5   0.0  102.6</p>
